G1: {{n_g1}} people who entered the rolling 24-month top 20. G2: {{n_g2}} people who never entered it and authored nothing at or after 24 months. Training years 2010–2023. The pass-2 figure d={{reference_d}} is the cumulative top 20 in two-year cohorts. The rolling groups recomputed here have within-cohort merge d={{d_raw}} (interval {{d_raw_ci}}).

## Decomposition

Size and prior pull requests leave d={{d_size}}. Patch content (lines, files, consensus paths, test-only share, bugfix titles, directories) leaves d={{d_content}} (interval {{d_content_ci}}). Review reception (tone received, a top-5 ACK, review cycles), with size held fixed, leaves d={{d_reception}} (interval {{d_reception_ci}}).

The social block alone leaves d={{d_s}} (interval {{d_s_ci}}). Reception and social participation together leave d={{d_both}}.

{{rule_text}}

Patch content does not close the gap. The closure inside the technical block is review reception, which is the community's own first-year response.

